#: ../../source/administration-guide/scale/elasticsearch-setup.rst:7
msgid ""
"Elasticsearch allows you to search large volumes of data quickly, in near"
" real-time, by creating and managing an index of post data. The indexing "
"process can be managed from the System Console after setting up and "
"connecting an Elasticsearch server. The post index is stored on the "
"Elasticsearch server and updated constantly after new posts are made. In "
"order to index existing posts, a bulk index of the entire post database "
"must be generated."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/scale/elasticsearch-setup.rst:9
msgid ""
"Deploying Elasticsearch includes the following two steps: `setting up "
"Elasticsearch <#set-up-elasticsearch>`__, and `configuring Mattermost "
"<#configure-mattermost>`_."
msgstr ""

